@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Healthcheck (Public - Check if Stripe is configured)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 2. Login (Demo User)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo@protography.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Fetch Portfolios with Prices (Protected)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Create Stripe Checkout Session (Protected - Real Price from DB)
# @name checkout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "portfolioId": 1
}

### 5. Order Lookup Endpoint (Check order payment status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
